    "name": "Timora Isle",
    "steam_appid": 3408190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a traditional farming sim developed by a two-person team. While paying tribute to the classics of the genre, we\u2019re also bringing brand-new and fun gameplay to deliver a fresh, surprise-filled experience. The game leans toward a more hardcore style\u2014where thoughtful decision-making matters. Simply grinding away might not yield great results, but building meaningful relationships with NPCs can give you powerful advantages in your farm life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a 12-year-old boy who inherits a rundown farm\u2014along with a heavy debt. Through hard work and clever management, you\u2019ll gradually repay what\u2019s owed and breathe new life into the old land, turning it into a thriving home. As you build a new life, you\u2019ll also uncover the many mysteries hidden around the farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Immersive Farming Life</strong><br>Start from scratch and freely design the life you want\u2014whether it\u2019s growing crops, raising animals, fishing, relaxing in hot springs, cooking, or brewing. Plan your days carefully and deal with all kinds of challenges as you steadily grow your farm into a flourishing paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/9439ef757a5e236d52d330adce724700.poster.avif?t=1754475287\" width=568 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/9439ef757a5e236d52d330adce724700.webm?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/9439ef757a5e236d52d330adce724700.mp4?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A More Authentic Farming System</strong><br>Crops are more realistically simulated here. You\u2019ll need to take proper care during each stage of growth while accounting for fertilizer, weather, pests, and more. For example, crops that require trellises won\u2019t survive without proper support\u2014they may yield nothing or even wither and die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/c4df800444c554a0e361f9cb9a6425c5.poster.avif?t=1754475287\" width=568 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/c4df800444c554a0e361f9cb9a6425c5.webm?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/c4df800444c554a0e361f9cb9a6425c5.mp4?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/420ecde6a2ae8dd4f5da630251e3d38f.poster.avif?t=1754475287\" width=568 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/420ecde6a2ae8dd4f5da630251e3d38f.webm?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/420ecde6a2ae8dd4f5da630251e3d38f.mp4?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Efficiency Through NPC Relationships</strong><br>You can grind your way to profit, but that\u2019s not the whole picture. Interacting with various NPCs will help you discover the unique advantages they offer. Strategic use of these interactions can make your efforts far more efficient\u2014leading to greater rewards with less time spent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/7babab1c84b5441265c159e0afa0aaad.poster.avif?t=1754475287\" width=568 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/7babab1c84b5441265c159e0afa0aaad.webm?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/7babab1c84b5441265c159e0afa0aaad.mp4?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Mysterious Sea</strong><br>What treasures await out at sea? New crop seeds? Rare crafting recipes? Strange and helpful NPCs? It\u2019s up to you to venture out and uncover the secrets. Let the unknown add excitement and depth to your farming journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/cb2bd84b123f46e4d7b83ccfbc35afab.poster.avif?t=1754475287\" width=568 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/cb2bd84b123f46e4d7b83ccfbc35afab.webm?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/cb2bd84b123f46e4d7b83ccfbc35afab.mp4?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/64e2fc660004c2de8f3113b0643139e0.poster.avif?t=1754475287\" width=568 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/64e2fc660004c2de8f3113b0643139e0.webm?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/64e2fc660004c2de8f3113b0643139e0.mp4?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Mysteries of the Spirits</strong><br>Different types of spirits dwell on and around your farm. What can they offer you? What surprises do they hide? Seek out their secrets and unlock your own unique moments of joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/049c276b47ddedecdd181990c206e6c5.poster.avif?t=1754475287\" width=568 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/049c276b47ddedecdd181990c206e6c5.webm?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/049c276b47ddedecdd181990c206e6c5.mp4?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Content Coming Soon</strong><br>As an indie project, development is no easy task. If you\u2019re interested, please consider adding us to your wishlist\u2014your support means the world to us. Thank you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a traditional farming sim developed by a two-person team. While paying tribute to the classics of the genre, we\u2019re also bringing brand-new and fun gameplay to deliver a fresh, surprise-filled experience. The game leans toward a more hardcore style\u2014where thoughtful decision-making matters. Simply grinding away might not yield great results, but building meaningful relationships with NPCs can give you powerful advantages in your farm life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a 12-year-old boy who inherits a rundown farm\u2014along with a heavy debt. Through hard work and clever management, you\u2019ll gradually repay what\u2019s owed and breathe new life into the old land, turning it into a thriving home. As you build a new life, you\u2019ll also uncover the many mysteries hidden around the farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Immersive Farming Life</strong><br>Start from scratch and freely design the life you want\u2014whether it\u2019s growing crops, raising animals, fishing, relaxing in hot springs, cooking, or brewing. Plan your days carefully and deal with all kinds of challenges as you steadily grow your farm into a flourishing paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/9439ef757a5e236d52d330adce724700.poster.avif?t=1754475287\" width=568 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/9439ef757a5e236d52d330adce724700.webm?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408190/extras/9439ef757a5e236d52d330adce724700.mp4?t=1754475287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A More